   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Consumed in GROUNDING, by everything that proposes",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r1037",
   "originalText": "Consumed in GROUNDING, by everything that proposes",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "t1039",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 678,
   "y": 1325,
   "width": 462.00000000000006,
   "height": 60.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0039",
   "seed": 17273,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 33507,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1785400000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "this is the whole point, and it is why the artifact is an input rather\nthan a graveyard. a rung cannot start without reading what was already\nruled out \u2014 which is what stops a dead option being re-proposed and\nre-argued from scratch months later.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "this is the whole point, and it is why the artifact is an input rather\nthan a graveyard. a rung cannot start without reading what was already\nruled out \u2014 which is what stops a dead option being re-proposed and\nre-argued from scratch months later.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "t1040",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1320,
   "y": 1261,
   "width": 165.0,
   "height": 150.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0040",
   "seed": 17280,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 33520,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1785400000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "SECOND CALLER for the\ngrounding column, and a\npartial answer to the\nreachability clause open\nsince this morning:\n\nit gets read because a\nrung CANNOT START without\nit \u2014 not because someone\nremembers to.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "SECOND CALLER for the\ngrounding column, and a\npartial answer to the\nreachability clause open\nsince this morning:\n\nit gets read because a\nrung CANNOT START without\nit \u2014 not because someone\nremembers to.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
